          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Yehowa wakambila Mose ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubadi tshisamba tshia Lewi nansha, kubadi bungi buabo munkatshi mua Bena Isalele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi usungule Bena Lewi bua kuenzabo mudimu mu nsubu wa tshitendelelu, ne wa bintu bionso bidimu bobo nebatuale nsubu ne bintu bionso bidimu, bobo nebabibale, nebashikame ha buihi ne nsubu wa tshitendelelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayabo ne nsubu wa tshitendelelu mu nshila, Bena Lewi nebatule nsubu, ne halongololabo tshitudilu, Bena Lewi nebamushimike, bialua muenyi ha buihi nebamushihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele nebadishimikile ntenta yabo, mundi ne muntu ku tshitudilu tshiandi, hehi ne dibendele diandi ku bisumbu biabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Bena Lewi nebashimike ntenta yabo minyunguluke nsubu wa tshitendelelu, bua mulau kaukuatshi Bena Isalele Bena Lewi nebabale nsubu wa tshitendelelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele bakenza nunku, bakenza malu onso akambila Yehowa Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
